Preserve the cleaned state through handling, packaging and time (@cm-preserve-clean: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @clean-manufacturing, #source "../sources/Cleaning-and-Surface-Properties-Taborelli.lingua#r_1RDARBEFXDAW9Y2DNTJ2QBEP2E", #source "../sources/Contamination-Control-Engineering-NASA.lingua#r_2XKKPYTW2DPQPQZ8VPV23BJ8A5", #clean-manufacturing "../studies/Investigate-residue-rinsing-and-sensitive-manufacturing.lingua#r_65132ZAF8SH9AMCB9401SP7Q4D") { r_5M8MZN0TGR8FB2VBGM1TR8VA0P
**Read:** [Cleaning and surface properties — Mauro Taborelli](../sources/Cleaning-and-Surface-Properties-Taborelli.lingua#r_1RDARBEFXDAW9Y2DNTJ2QBEP2E), section 3.5 and the complete packaging comparison; [Contamination control engineering — Tribble and colleagues, NASA CR 4740](../sources/Contamination-Control-Engineering-NASA.lingua#r_2XKKPYTW2DPQPQZ8VPV23BJ8A5), contamination control through handling and storage.

The final rinse is followed by contacts, air exposure, packaging, transport and waiting. Packaging can block one source while introducing extractables, particles, vapor or incompatible contact material. A protective method proven for one surface need not preserve another.

State the condition at the end of cleaning and at the point of use. A time-dependent observation can reflect oxidation, adsorption, redistribution or release from a reservoir. Preserve process and exposure history with the specimen instead of comparing results from unknown elapsed times.

**Work:** Design a storage comparison using realistic contacts, temperatures and duration. Include package-only blanks, handling controls and a functional observation after opening. Account for the package's own contribution and distinguish a measured stable interval from an indefinite shelf-life claim. Carry the result into the later lifecycle and maintenance formation.

**Return:** [Clean manufacturing and contamination control — from familiar objects to controlled processes](../Clean-manufacturing-and-contamination-control.lingua#r_7D8SQ8BVQDZQBDBGC6DP0JAMZN).
**Continue in clean manufacturing:** [Investigate residue, rinsing and sensitive manufacturing](../studies/Investigate-residue-rinsing-and-sensitive-manufacturing.lingua#r_65132ZAF8SH9AMCB9401SP7Q4D).

